## Soulglass — base language.
## Every other file is a translation of this one. Keys missing from a
## translation fall back to en_US, so no player ever sees a raw key.
##
## The marker is a soul lantern, and that is what it is called throughout —
## the same name the player reads in their inventory. Calling it a grave
## described the function instead of the object in front of them.

pack.name=§bSoulglass §3[§bRP§3]
pack.description=§fYour items and experience wait for you in a soul lantern, lit where you died.

